2 81.3 L197.1 160.5 A104 104 0 0 0 160.5 197.1Z" fill="var(--w-future)"/><text class="wn" x="136.9" y="132.9">Service</text><text class="wv" x="136.9" y="146.9">by Serving</text><text class="wm" x="166.6" y="169.6">10</text><line class="wg" x1="159.9" y1="198.0" x2="80.3" y2="152.0"/><g transform="translate(59.5 140.0)"><rect x="-19" y="-12" width="38" height="24" rx="12" class="gbg"/><path d="M-13 6V-4M-4 6V-4M-13-4Q-8.5-8.5-4-4" class="gi"/><path d="M-4 5.5L-8 3.5V-3.5" class="gi gleaf"/><circle cx="4.5" cy="0" r="3.4" class="gi gk"/><path d="M7.9 0H15M12 0V3.2M15 0V3.2" class="gi gkey"/></g><path d="M153.8 79.2 A196 196 0 0 1 247.9 54.0 L248.9 146.0 A104 104 0 0 0 198.9 159.4Z" fill="var(--w-future)"/><text class="wn" x="208.6" y="91.5">Sharing</text><text class="wv" x="208.6" y="105.5">by Showing</text><text class="wm" x="219.5" y="139.0">11</text><circle cx="250" cy="250" r="94" fill="var(--w-core)"/><text class="wc0" x="250" y="226">ONE</text><text class="wc1" x="250" y="268">YEAR</text><text class="wc2" x="250" y="300">11 chambers · 9 gates</text></svg></div><div class="pcards mtiles"><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1653656120996-57c14eff3ee9?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two women relaxing on a couch at home, talking easily, completely themselves" style="object-position:45% 40%" loading="lazy" /><b>You being you.</b></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1683621284476-549af8467c8d?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Three generations cooking a fresh vegetable stir-fry together" style="object-position:55% 40%" loading="lazy" /><b>You healing you.</b></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758272959140-e727ef77bbda?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two hikers reading a trail map together, one looking ahead to where they are going" style="object-position:40% 40%" loading="lazy" /><b>You planning you.</b></div></div></div>
      <p class="sec-prose">The year moves through eleven chambers, one part of your life at a time: your past, your present and your future. Along the way are nine gates, and each one opens when a daily practice stops being something you try and becomes something you live.</p>
      <div class="ctarow appr-cta"><button class="btn btn-line" type="button" data-vpop="/img/russ/v2/how-it-works.mp4" data-vpop-poster="/img/russ/v2/how-it-works-poster.jpg">Watch the video</button><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/method/">See the approach</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="parts"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Start where life is loudest.</h2></div>
      <div class="pcards"><a class="pcard pc-past" href="/as-learned/"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1475609471617-0ef53b59cff5?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A parent holding a child close" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">The past</span><b>Learning your past</b><em>How you were wired, and what still runs you.</em></a><a class="pcard pc-now" href="/as-loved/"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511632765486-a01980e01a18?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Friends with their arms around each other at sunset" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">The present</span><b>Loving your present</b><em>Connected to yourself and the people around you.</em></a><a class="pcard pc-fut" href="/as-lived/"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593100126453-19b562a800c1?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A grandmother hugging her grandchild" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">The future</span><b>Living your future</b><em>Possibility, purpose and the legacy you leave.</em></a></div>
      <p class="sec-prose">Every part of your life is connected, so we begin with whatever is asking for you most right now. From there you learn from where you have been, love where you are, and live toward where you are going.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec appr" id="problem"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Listen</p><h2>Finish where life is quietest.</h2><p class="lede">A softer view of how hard the world is.</p></div>
      <div class="appr-grid"><figure class="appr-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565813086292-604790c8a97b?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two old friends sharing a warm embrace in a crowded room, one smiling with his eyes" style="object-position:60% 35%;transform:scale(1.3);transform-origin:78% 45%" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="appr-copy">
      <p class="listen-prose">The world is loud, and it can leave the best of us feeling small. Here, at the quiet end of the day, you get to be big again: empowered instead of worn down, seen for who you really are, and heard all the way to the end of what you have to say.</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="qt" id="qt" role="group" aria-label="Heard, not unheard. Seen, not unseen. Empowered, not disempowered."><div class="qt__i" style="--i:0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="qt__n">not unheard</span><span class="qt__p">Heard</span></div><div class="qt__i" style="--i:1" aria-hidden="true"><span class="qt__n">not unseen</span><span class="qt__p">Seen</span></div><div class="qt__i" style="--i:2" aria-hidden="true"><span class="qt__n">not disempowered</span><span class="qt__p">Empowered</span></div></div>
    </div></section>

