    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">Start free. Meet Russ. Then choose your plan.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Start free</h3><p>Sign up for free access: a welcome letter and short video from Russ, the Vault Key in your inbox, and your first module. No card.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Meet Russ</h3><p>Book a free 30-minute virtual conversation. It is part of your free assessment: no payment, no pitch, just where you are and where to start.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Choose your plan</h3><p>Most people begin with the monthly membership: the year-long coaching modules, a key a day, in the <a href="/writing/#letters">Vault Keys archive</a>, plus a live monthly call led by Russ on that month’s chamber.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#daily-key">Start free</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark vid-sec" id="russ"><video class="bgvid" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/47818/47818-720.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Founder of Vault Human</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">An attorney and a twenty-year operator who coaches from the whole picture: how you were built, how you are living, and what you intend to leave. He chose and ordered every key.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/speaking/">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/speaking/#book">Book Russ to speak</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="after"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">A year from now</p><h2>What changes.</h2></div>
      <div class="tl" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tl-past">Past</span><span class="tl-now">Present</span><span class="tl-fut">Future</span><span class="tl-flow"></span></div>
      <div class="after"><div><b>You know why.</b><p>You can see the patterns you learned, and you choose which ones to keep.</p></div><div><b>You're here.</b><p>Present with yourself and the people you love, not just near them.</p></div><div><b>You're building.</b><p>A future you chose, and a life worth handing on.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec" id="ways"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Five ways to be coached</p><h2>Coaching that fits your life.</h2></div><div class="gallery five"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/inperson.jpg" alt="Russ reading aloud to a group by a stone fireplace" style="object-position:50% 18%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>One on one</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/retreat.jpg" alt="A men’s circle gathered in a mountain meadow" style="object-position:50% 60%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a group</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609260840244-22b52bfc6664?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Three generations of a family together on the porch" style="object-position:50% 35%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a family</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542323228-002ac256e7b8?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Men and women on a team stacking their hands together" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a team</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1752659504423-87916d12bc37?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Colleagues of different generations planning together" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>As a business</figcaption></figure></div><div class="ctarow" style="margin-top:30px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/plans/">Plans</a></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Plans and pricing</p><h2>Simple to start.</h2></div>
      <div class="member"><div><p class="tag">Step one for everyone</p><h3>The Vault Keys membership</h3><p>A Vault Key every morning, the full coaching year in the <a href="/writing/#letters">Vault Keys archive</a>, and a live coaching call with Russ every month. Every way to be coached includes it.</p></div><div class="member-price"><div class="price">$99<small>/mo</small></div><p class="guarantee">Your first week is on us. Cancel any time.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZu8wP9Jl9fO1d2dqU6Na00">Begin · first week free</a></div></div>
      <div class="plans"><div class="plan"><h3>One on one</h3><div class="price">$999<small>/mo</small></div><p>Three private 60-minute sessions a month with Russ, messages between sessions, and the Vault Keys membership included.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/28E00jaNpfEc3la9aE6Na02">Begin one on one</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a group</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your group</div><p>Groups of 5 to 10, meeting twice a month. Bring your own group or join one.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a family</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your family</div><p>Family sessions together and a check-in for each person, priced by family size.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a team</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your team</div><p>Priced by team size, goals and length. Most engagements run three to six months.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a business</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your business</div><p>Leadership and team coaching, plus Vault Keys for your people at a volume rate.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every plan starts the same way: start free, then a free 30-minute call with Russ. Prices in US dollars, billed monthly.</p>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:18px"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/plans/">See all plans</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What is Vault Human?</summary><p>Vault Human is daily coaching for the whole of you.</p></details><details><summary>How do I start?</summary><p>Start free. Book a free 30-minute call with Russ. Then choose your plan.</p></details><details><summary>What are keys, chambers and gates?</summary><p>Keys are the daily lessons. Chambers are the parts of your life. Gates open when a lesson becomes a habit.</p></details><details><summary>What are the 360 and the 180?</summary><p>The 360 are keys for the mind. The 180 are keys for the body. See <a href="/the-360/">the 360</a> and <a href="/the-180/">the 180</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Who coaches me?</summary><p>Russ Michaels is the founder of Vault Human. Our Vault coaches, Russ included, coach you.</p></details><details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>Anything valuable takes time. We aim to complete the full picture of Vault Human in a year, at your pace, with a coach as your guide the whole way.</p></details><details><summary>Can my team or my family be coached?</summary><p>Yes. We coach teams, businesses and families. Each starts with a free conversation.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. It's coaching. We are not therapists or doctors, and coaching is not therapy or medical care.</p></details><details><summary>What does the first week cost?</summary><p>Nothing. Your first week is on us.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Any time, with no fee.</p></details><details><summary>What are Fretwork, Triplicity and Tercet?</summary><p>Sister companies in the Vault Human family: <a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork Systems</a> (automation and AI for small teams), <a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity Advisory</a> (leadership and team coaching) and <a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> (wills, trusts and succession).</p></details></div>
